  "post_content": "<p>La tarde de este mi&eacute;rcoles, la asociaci&oacute;n Adolor Onda ha presentado en el sal&oacute;n de actos del Centro de Empleo y Cultura&nbsp;las 14 actividades programadas para este curso 2013/14.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/09/IMG-20130911-WA003.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px\" /></p>\n<p>Monitores y monitoras han ido explicando en qu&eacute; consisten las clases de yoga, pilates, taichi, gimnasia, baile, zumba, danza oriental, estiramientos, sevillanas inicio y avanzado, zumba gold, o los talleres Emociones y salud. Sentir de forma saludable y Entrenar la memoria, nivel inicial.</p>\n<p>Despu&eacute;s, las personas que lo han deseado han podido inscribirse en las actividades que les interesaban, previa inscripci&oacute;n como socias, con una cuota de 20 euros.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img-20130911-wa000.jpg\" alt=\"img-20130911-wa000\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img-20130911-wa001.jpg\" alt=\"img-20130911-wa001\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img-20130911-wa003.jpg\" alt=\"img-20130911-wa003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img_7387.jpg\" alt=\"img_7387\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img_7388.jpg\" alt=\"img_7388\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img_7389.jpg\" alt=\"img_7389\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img_7390.jpg\" alt=\"img_7390\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img_7391.jpg\" alt=\"img_7391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img_7392.jpg\" alt=\"img_7392\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img_7393.jpg\" alt=\"img_7393\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img_7394.jpg\" alt=\"img_7394\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img_7396.jpg\" alt=\"img_7396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img_7397.jpg\" alt=\"img_7397\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenactivitatsadolor13-14/img_7398.jpg\" alt=\"img_7398\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
